        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana BBS2010, Modern Robe Hook</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nA hook such as this is as useful in the kitchen as it is in the bathroom. A stylish way to hang a robe, towels, or even a lady's purse, it's a beautiful, modern way to keep things off the floor in any room. This bathroom hook is made out of solid brass with the attention to quality that Deltana is known for. The Sobe Series Robe Hook features concealed screw mounting for a sleek contemporary look. The modern styling means it will look good in even the most fashionable homes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-BBS2010-specifications.gif?v=1704354516\" width=\"600\" height=\"212\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana BBS2010 Sobe Double Robe Hook Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nShop more of the <a href=\"/search?type=product&q=Deltana BBS Sobe Series\"><b>Deltana Sobe Series Bathroom Accessories</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Sobe Bathroom or Kitchen Towel Hook:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Hook Length: 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Wall Mount Diameter: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Concealed screw mounting for a clean, contemporary look.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-BBS2010.pdf?v=1691095352\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana BBS2010 Sobe Double Robe Hook Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold Individually.</b> Package includes: 1 robe hook, mounting screw cover, and all necessary mounting screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>This is a Limited Series. <b>Limited Quantities Available</b></i>\r\n</p>",
